Haber-Bosch process is used for the synthesis of ammonia.

\mathrm{N}_2+3 \mathrm{H}_2 \rightleftharpoons 2 \mathrm{NH}_3 ; \Delta H=-92.0 \mathrm{~kJ}

The best catalyst for this reaction is highly porous finely divided iron containing small amounts of promoters usually molybdenum or oxides of potassium and aluminium.
